# dist/<pack>/ of a pack drawn for this repo may be committed (prebuilt .ans art, so users don't need Python)
.venv/
previews/
__pycache__/
.gstack/
# the real-card pokemon pack is built locally by tools/build_realcards.py and never committed: its art embeds
# the pokemon-colorscripts sprites (Nintendo artwork) and its card text is copyrighted (pack.json stays tracked)
# users get dist/pokemon/ from the gshklovs/pokeshell-art release art.json pins (install downloads it;
# tools/publish_art.ps1 publishes it, docs/ART_RELEASES.md)
packs/pokemon/art/
packs/pokemon/cards/
dist/pokemon/
